 ;-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
; File:         Centroid_OAK_Mill_ATC_Umbrella-r14.src
; Corresponding Schematic: S15182.DWG - 220VAC, SureServo2 Drives
;                          S15098.DWG - 440VAC, Yaskawa Drives
;                          S14798.DWG - 220VAC, Yaskawa Drives
;                          S14845.DWG - 220VAC, Delta Drives
;                          S14807.DWG - 220VAC, Estun Drives
;                          S14804.DWG - 220VAC, Generic Drives
;                          S14907.DWG - ACDC 60 AMP Drives
;                          S14868.DWG - ACDC 30 AMP Drives
; Programmer:	Scott Pratt, Christopher Bowser
; Date:			26 Jun 2020
; Purpose:      PLC for OAK w/ Wireless MPG, VCP, and Umbrella Tool Changer
; Requires:		CNC12 v5.40.00+

; AuxKeys:
; Aux 7 Key: Worklight Toggle
; Aux  8 Key: Index Carousel -
; Aux  9 Key: Index Carousel +

; Revisions:
; 08 Jan 2026 CTB Corrected VCP Jog Keys under JogKeysInvert2Stage and JogKeysSwapAndInvert2Stage.
; 12 Dec 2025 CTB Fixed MPG_LED_OUT_O being omitted from MPGLED_O Logic.
; 27 Oct 2025 CTB Corrected Logic for Kb Spindle CW/CCW so that it does not conflict with
;                 VCP or Jog Panel CW/CCW Spindle Keys.
;                 Added Delay Timer for AirPressureOk. Intended for systems that may experience
;                   a brief drop in pressure during actuation.
; 29 Jul 2025 CTB Added Optic Direct Load Meters logic.
; 03 Jul 2025 CTB Added External USB Logic for Connectivity Checking and
;                   Feed, Spindle, and Rapid Adjustment Knobs.
; 15 May 2025 CTB Added Seperate Rapid Feed Rate Logic via Parameter 264
;                 Added SV_ESTOP_PRESSED & SV_RESET_PRESSED logic for CNC12.
; 12 May 2025 CTB Added Spindle Scaling via Parameter 78 bit 4 (Add 16).
; 19 Sep 2024 CTB Added ctrl requirement for keyboard jogging.
;                 Added Keyboard Jogging keys to numpad including the diagonal directions.
;                 Added checks to all Keyboard shortcuts that no other "modifier" key is pressed.
;                 Added X Direction Jog Key Stages for Parameter 1 (Add16)
; 26 Jul 2023 CTB Can now change Incr/Cont, Fast/Slow, and/or X1, X10, X100
;                   on Jog Panel with an active WMPG while MPG LED is off.
; 21 Jul 2023 CTB Added SV_NV_W1 to remember LastCarouselDir_W on powercycle.
; 19 Jul 2023 CTB Added Missing SpindleFan_O Logic
; 23 May 2023 CTB Corrected 75, 50, 25% Feedrate override buttons for VCP.
; 12 May 2023 CTB Changed functionality of coolant auto/man button to turn
;                   off flood/mist when switching from auto to manual.
;                 Added Skin and WMPG Jog Functions for Axis 5 and 6.
;                 Updated WMPG Behavior for X100, X10, X1
;                   X1 = Incremental + Slow Jog
;                   X10 = Continuous + Slow Jog
;                   X100 = Continuous + Fast Jog
; 17 Apr 2023 CTB Implimented Label Specific Drive Errors
;                 Updated PLC to "Standard"
;                 Added Z Axis MPG X100 Lockout Functionality via Parameter 19
;                 Added Timer to wait 100ms before resetting SV_SYS_MACRO
;                   back to 0 for WMPG Macro keys, makes it more reliable
; 04 Feb 2022 CTB Consolidated VCP Reset and EStop into "EStop and Reset Section"
;                 Moved Jog Panel Functions from MPG Stages to JogPanelStage
;                 Removed W31 Echo for Feedrate
; 01 Sep 2020 CTB Corrected Logic for Incremental Buttons for VCP using Wireless,
;                 Corrected Axis swap logic for Wireless Jog Buttons.
; 07 Aug 2020 CTB Added OUT1107 for Reset Button "LED" for VCP2
; 26 Jun 2020 CTB Echoed W4 to W31 for VCP2 FeedRate Display
; 03 Mar 2020 CTB Added RST Logic on Estop for 6th, 7th, and 8th Axis Resets
; 18 Oct 2019 CEM Added 6th, 7th and 8th Axis resets and error messages.
; 11 Jun 2019 CDR Added Safety Switch
; 16 Apr 2019 CDR Corrected ZeroTo5Or10Stage and Minus5Or10ToPlus5Or10Stage logic
; 29 Mar 2019 MML Correct AnalogInput4 and AnalogInput5 definition
; 26 Feb 2019 MML Red button on wireless MPG acts like Cycle Cancel
; 20 Nov 2018 MML Removed EstopOk from setting ResetSet
; 16 Oct 2018 MML	Updated USB MPG feedrate logic
; 25 Sep 2018 MML	Added logic for VCP increments

; Local Revisions
; 260501 - BJF - Commented out LubeOk_I input (280), fault (4019/20), and warning (4022/23)
; 260501 - BJF - Added SpinAgree_I for input 9


; Params:
; SV_MACHINE_PARAMETER_1   : Add 2 = Invert Ax2 Jog Keys,
;                            Add 4 = Swap Ax1 and Ax2
;                            Add 16 = Invert Ax1 Jog Keys
; SV_MACHINE_PARAMETER_6   : ATC Installed
; SV_MACHINE_PARAMETER_19  : MPG Modes
;                            Add 1 = MPG Ignore Encoder Error
;                            Add 2 = Lock Out Z Axis X100 with WMPG
;                            Add 4 = Enable Independent Z-Axis MPG Jogging
; SV_MACHINE_PARAMETER_39  : Feedrate Override Percentage Limit
; SV_MACHINE_PARAMETER_57  : Use Generic PLC Load Meters
; SV_MACHINE_PARAMETER_65  : Low Range Gear Ratio
; SV_MACHINE_PARAMETER_66  : Medium-Low Range Gear Ratio
; SV_MACHINE_PARAMETER_67  : Medium-High Range Gear Ratio
; SV_MACHINE_PARAMETER_78  : Spindle Speed Display and Operations
;                            Add 1  = Display Actual Spindle Speed (No longer use SV_PLC_SPINDLE_SPEED)
;                            Add 16 = Scale Spindle Analog Output to Min/Max RPM.
; SV_MACHINE_PARAMETER_146 : FeedHold Threshold, Sets FeedHold Under Value
; SV_MACHINE_PARAMETER_148 : 0 = Keyboard Jogging Allowed, 2 = Prohibit Keyboard Jogging
; SV_MACHINE_PARAMETER_153 : 0 = Disable Probe Protection, 1 = Enable Probe Protection
; SV_MACHINE_PARAMETER_161 : ATC Maximum Tool Bins
; SV_MACHINE_PARAMETER_164 : ATC Features
;                            1 = ATC Reset Feature for Umbrella
; SV_MACHINE_PARAMETER_170 : Add 1 = Keyboard Jogging Enable,
;							 Add 2 = Feedrate Override Jog Panel Only,
;							 Add 4 = Feedrate Override Keyboard Only
; SV_MACHINE_PARAMETER_179 : LubePump Settings, MMMSS (Minutes, Seconds)
; SV_MACHINE_PARAMETER_218 = 0 = Wired MPG, > 0 = Wireless MPG 
; SV_MACHINE_PARAMETER_219 = 0 = No VCP, 1 = Start VCP on boot
; SV_MACHINE_PARAMETER_264 : Rapid Override Settings
;                             Add 1 = Enable Rapid Override Feature
;                             Add 2 = Display Seperate Rapid Override %
;                             Add 4 = Enable Rapid/Feed Link Feature
; SV_MACHINE_PARAMETER_348 : MPG 1 Encoder
; SV_MACHINE_PARAMETER_351 : MPG 2 Encoder
; SV_MACHINE_PARAMETER_354 : MPG 3 Encoder
; SV_MACHINE_PARAMETER_441 : MPG 1 Axis Select
; SV_MACHINE_PARAMETER_442 : MPG 2 Axis Select
; SV_MACHINE_PARAMETER_443 : MPG 3 Axis Select
; SV_MACHINE_PARAMETER_820 : Mill = 0, Lathe = 1, Router = 2, Plasma = 3, Laser = 4, (future) etc...
; SV_MACHINE_PARAMETER_852 : Skip Count Setting
; SV_MACHINE_PARAMETER_900 : PLC ADD Installed
; SV_MACHINE_PARAMETER_911-915 : Invert Inputs 1-16, 17-32, 33-48, 49-64, 65-80
; SV_MACHINE_PARAMETER_916-920 : Force Inputs 1-16, 17-32, 33-48, 49-64, or 65-80
; SV_MACHINE_PARAMETER_921-925 : Force OUTPUTS 1-16, 17-32, 33-48, 49-64, or 65-80 ON
; SV_MACHINE_PARAMETER_926-930 : Force OUTPUTS 1-16, 17-32, 33-48, 49-64, or 65-80 OFF
; SV_MACHINE_PARAMETER_931-940 : Used for MEM Bit Force On/Off
; SV_MACHINE_PARAMETER_961 : Carousel In Out Timer (s), Defaults to 2 seconds when 0.
; SV_MACHINE_PARAMETER_962 : Orient Time Out (s), Defaults to 2 seconds when 0.
; SV_MACHINE_PARAMETER_963 : Orient Lost Timer (ms), Defaults to 100ms when 0.
; SV_MACHINE_PARAMETER_964 : Tool Clamp/Unclamp Timer (s), Defaults to 2s when 0.
; SV_MACHINE_PARAMETER_965 : Air Pressure Fault Delay (ms)
; SV_MACHINE_PARAMETER_982 : SSV Cycle Time (s)
; SV_MACHINE_PARAMETER_983 : SSV Amount
; SV_MACHINE_PARAMETER_984 : FRV Cycle Time (ms)
; SV_MACHINE_PARAMETER_997 : SpindleChillTimer (in seconds)

; The OAK board includes connections for several types of auxiliary I/O.
; 4 digital "high speed" inputs (INP769-772) typically used for probe/TT1
; related functions, 3 auxiliary digital inputs (INP784-786), 11 Digital inputs
; used for MPG increment and axis selection and 2 auxiliary digital outputs
; (Out770-771).

; Inputs: The OAK provides 33 inputs, 16 of which (1-16) are available for
; general purpose use.  Inputs 1-16 can be configured for 5, 12 or 24VDC
; operation in either a sourcing or sinking configuration.

; Outputs: The OAK has 9 relay contact closure outputs.  Outputs 1-7
; are SPST type relays while Outputs 8 & 9 are SPDT type relays.
; Outputs 15 and 16 are for internal PLC hardware use only, being used to 
; set the mode of operatuon for the spindle analog output.

; Analog output: The 16 bit analog output on the OAK
; is mapped to outputs 241-256.

